function infer(type,mapped){const out=[];if(type==='customers'&&!mapped['Hourly Rate']){const h=num(mapped['Labor Hours']),a=num(mapped['Labor Amount']);if(h&&h>0&&a!=null&&a>=0){const v=(Math.round(a/h*100)/100).toFixed(2);mapped['Hourly Rate']=v;out.push({field:'Hourly Rate',value:v,reason:`Labor Amount ÷ Labor Hours (${a} ÷ ${h})`});}}if(type==='timeEntries'&&!mapped.Hours&&mapped['Start Time']&&mapped['End Time']){const s=new Date(mapped['Start Time']),e=new Date(mapped['End Time']);if(!Number.isNaN(s.getTime())&&!Number.isNaN(e.getTime())&&e>s){const v=Math.round(((e-s)/3600000)*100)/100;mapped.Hours=String(v);out.push({field:'Hours',value:String(v),reason:'End Time − Start Time'});}}if(type==='priceBook'&&!mapped['Selling Price']){const lo=num(mapped['Price Low']),hi=num(mapped['Price High']);if(lo!=null&&hi!=null&&hi>=lo){const v=(Math.round(((lo+hi)/2)*100)/100).toFixed(2);mapped['Selling Price']=v;out.push({field:'Selling Price',value:v,reason:`Midpoint of Price Low and Price High (${lo} – ${hi})`});}}return out;}
const existingCache=new Map();
async function existing(collection){if(existingCache.has(collection))return existingCache.get(collection);const businessId=bid();if(!businessId)throw new Error('Open the business you want to import into first.');const c=client();if(!c)throw new Error('Secure Business Office connection is not ready.');const p=c.from('business_records').select('record_key,payload').eq('business_id',businessId).eq('collection',collection).eq('record_status','active').limit(5000).then(({data,error})=>{if(error)throw error;return data||[];});existingCache.set(collection,p);return p;}
function customerTokens(p,recordKey=''){return{id:low(p['Customer ID']||recordKey),email:low(p.Email),phone:phone(p['Mobile Phone']||p.Phone||p['Alternate Phone']),address:addr(p['Service Address']||p.Address),name:low(p['Customer Name']||p['Company / Business Name']||p['Contact Person']),company:low(p['Company / Business Name'])};}
function matchCustomer(mapped,list){const q=customerTokens(mapped);let best=null;for(const r of list){const t=customerTokens(r.payload||{},r.record_key);let score=0,why=[];if(q.id&&t.id&&q.id===t.id){score+=100;why.push('customer ID');}if(q.email&&t.email&&q.email===t.email){score+=70;why.push('email');}if(q.phone&&t.phone&&q.phone===t.phone){score+=55;why.push('phone');}if(q.address&&t.address&&q.address===t.address){score+=45;why.push('service address');}if(q.name&&t.name&&q.name===t.name){score+=25;why.push('name');}if(q.company&&t.company&&q.company===t.company){score+=25;why.push('company');}if((score>=70||(score>=65&&q.address&&(q.name||q.company)))&&(!best||score>best.score))best={recordKey:r.record_key,payload:r.payload||{},score,why};}return best;}
function explicitMatch(type,mapped,list){if(type==='customers')return matchCustomer(mapped,list);const c=ENTITY[type],id=txt(mapped[c?.idField]),secondary=type==='invoices'?txt(mapped['Invoice Number']):type==='quotes'?txt(mapped['Quote Number']):type==='priceBook'?txt(mapped.SKU):'';if(id){const f=list.find(r=>low(r.record_key)===low(id)||low(r.payload?.[c.idField])===low(id));if(f)return{recordKey:f.record_key,payload:f.payload||{},score:100,why:[c.idField]};}if(secondary){const field=type==='invoices'?'Invoice Number':type==='quotes'?'Quote Number':'SKU',f=list.find(r=>low(r.payload?.[field])===low(secondary));if(f)return{recordKey:f.record_key,payload:f.payload||{},score:85,why:[field]};}if(type==='properties'){const customer=low(mapped['Customer ID']),addressKey=addr(mapped['Service Address']||mapped.Address);if(customer&&addressKey){const f=list.find(r=>low(r.payload?.['Customer ID'])===customer&&addr(r.payload?.['Service Address']||r.payload?.Address)===addressKey);if(f)return{recordKey:f.record_key,payload:f.payload||{},score:80,why:['customer + address']};}}return null;}
function safeMerge(mapped,match){const old=match?.payload||{},out={...old},conflicts=[],enriched=[];for(const [field,value] of Object.entries(mapped)){if(!txt(value))continue;const cur=txt(old[field]);if(!cur){out[field]=value;if(match)enriched.push(field);}else if(low(cur)!==low(value)){conflicts.push({field,existing:cur,spreadsheet:value});out[field]=old[field];}else out[field]=old[field];}return{out,conflicts,enriched};}
function identity(type,m){const c=ENTITY[type],fields=[c?.idField,'Invoice Number','Quote Number','Reference Number','Email','Phone','Service Address','Address','Project Title','Expense Date','Payment Date','Start Time','Amount','Total','Customer Name'].filter(Boolean);return fields.map(f=>`${f}:${txt(m[f])}`).filter(x=>!x.endsWith(':')).join('|');}
function stableKey(type,m,sheet,row){const explicit=txt(m[ENTITY[type]?.idField]);if(explicit)return explicit;return`IMPORT-${String(type).replace(/[^a-z0-9]/gi,'-').toUpperCase()}-${hash(`${sheet}|${identity(type,m)||JSON.stringify(m)}|${row}`)}`;}
function addCustomerRefs(refs,m,recordKey){const t=customerTokens(m,recordKey);if(t.id)refs.set(`id:${t.id}`,recordKey);if(t.email)refs.set(`email:${t.email}`,recordKey);if(t.phone)refs.set(`phone:${t.phone}`,recordKey);if(t.name)refs.set(`name:${t.name}`,recordKey);if(t.company)refs.set(`name:${t.company}`,recordKey);}
function resolveCustomerRef(m,refs){const raw=txt(m['Customer ID']);if(raw&&refs.has(`id:${low(raw)}`)){m['Customer ID']=refs.get(`id:${low(raw)}`);return;}for(const [field,prefix] of [['Email','email'],['Phone','phone'],['Customer Name','name']]){const v=prefix==='phone'?phone(m[field]):low(m[field]);if(v&&refs.has(`${prefix}:${v}`)){m['Customer ID']=refs.get(`${prefix}:${v}`);return;}}}
async function prepareGroup(group,customerRefs){const type=group.type,businessId=bid(),collection=type==='historicalRecords'?'historicalRecords':ENTITY[type].collection,list=await existing(collection),rows=[],preview=[],sourceRows=group.sourceRows||group.rows,summary={sourceRows:sourceRows.length,newRecords:0,matchedExisting:0,enrichedExisting:0,conflicts:0,inferred:0,needsReview:0,linkedLocations:0,skippedRows:0};group.dispositions=columnDispositions(group);const overlay=buildOverlay(group),dispList=group.dispositions.map(d=>`${d.name}: ${d.disposition} (${d.detail})`);for(let i=0;i<sourceRows.length;i++){const raw=sourceRows[i],{mapped,confirmed}=mapRow(type,raw,overlay);if(type!=='customers')resolveCustomerRef(mapped,customerRefs);if(!Object.keys(mapped).length){summary.skippedRows++;summary.needsReview++;preview.push({row:i+2,name:'',match:'Skipped',status:'Needs review',issues:['No recognized fields']});continue;}const inferred=infer(type,mapped),match=type==='historicalRecords'?null:explicitMatch(type,mapped,list),merged=safeMerge(mapped,match),issues=[];if(type==='customers'&&!txt(mapped['Customer Name']||mapped['Company / Business Name']||mapped.Email||mapped.Phone))issues.push('No usable customer identity');if(merged.conflicts.length)issues.push(`${merged.conflicts.length} conflict${merged.conflicts.length===1?'':'s'} with existing record`);const status=issues.length?'Needs review':inferred.length?'Inferred from spreadsheet':'Confirmed from spreadsheet',recordKey=match?.recordKey||(type==='historicalRecords'?`IMPORT-HISTORY-${hash(`${group.sheet}|${JSON.stringify(mapped)}|${i+1}`)}`:stableKey(type,mapped,group.sheet,i+1)),payload={...merged.out,...mapped,'Business ID':businessId,'Import Source':group.file,'Import Sheet':group.sheet,'Historical Import':true,'Import Review Status':status,'Import Match':match?`Matched existing by ${match.why.join(', ')}`:'New record','Import Confirmed Fields':confirmed.map(x=>`${x.field} ← ${x.source}`),'Import Inferred Fields':inferred.map(x=>`${x.field}: ${x.value} (${x.reason})`),'Import Confirmed Rates':confirmed.filter(x=>RATE_FIELDS.has(x.field)).map(x=>`${x.field}: ${x.value}`),'Import Inferred Rates':inferred.filter(x=>RATE_FIELDS.has(x.field)).map(x=>`${x.field}: ${x.value} (${x.reason})`),'Import Needs Review':issues,'Import Conflicts':merged.conflicts.map(x=>`${x.field}: existing “${x.existing}” vs spreadsheet “${x.spreadsheet}”`),'Import Column Dispositions':dispList,'Import Source Row':i+2};rows.push({targetCollection:collection,targetRecordKey:recordKey,rawPayload:raw,normalizedPayload:payload});if(match){summary.matchedExisting++;if(merged.enriched.length)summary.enrichedExisting++;}else summary.newRecords++;summary.conflicts+=merged.conflicts.length;summary.inferred+=inferred.length;if(issues.length)summary.needsReview++;if(type==='customers'){addCustomerRefs(customerRefs,mapped,recordKey);const address=[mapped['Service Address'],mapped['Service Address 2'],[mapped['Service City'],mapped['Service State'],mapped['Service ZIP']].filter(Boolean).join(' ')].filter(Boolean).join(', ');if(address){const propertyKey=`IMPORT-PROPERTY-${recordKey}-${hash(address)}`,property={'Property ID':propertyKey,'Business ID':businessId,'Customer ID':recordKey,'Property Name':'Primary service location','Address':address,'Service Address':mapped['Service Address']||'','Service Address 2':mapped['Service Address 2']||'','City':mapped['Service City']||'','State':mapped['Service State']||'','ZIP':mapped['Service ZIP']||'','Status':'Active','Import Source':group.file,'Import Sheet':group.sheet,'Historical Import':true,'Import Source Row':i+2};rows.push({targetCollection:'properties',targetRecordKey:propertyKey,rawPayload:raw,normalizedPayload:property});summary.linkedLocations++;}}preview.push({row:i+2,name:txt(mapped['Customer Name']||mapped['Company / Business Name']||mapped['Project Title']||mapped['Invoice Number']||mapped['Quote Number']||mapped[ENTITY[type]?.idField]||mapped.Description||'Record'),match:match?'Existing':'New',status,issues});}return{...group,collection,rows,preview,summary};}
async function buildPlan(file){existingCache.clear();stagedRuns.clear();const sheets=await readWorkbook(file);if(!sheets.length)throw new Error('No workbook rows were found.');const detected=sheets.map(s=>({...s,detection:detect(s)})).sort((a,b)=>(a.detection.type==='customers'?-1:0)-(b.detection.type==='customers'?-1:0)),customerRefs=new Map(),groups=[];planCustomerRefs=customerRefs;for(const sheet of detected){const type=sheet.detection.type,group={id:`${type}-${hash(sheet.name)}`,type,sheet:sheet.name,file:file.name,rows:sheet.rows,sourceRows:sheet.rows,inventory:columnInventory(sheet.rows),choices:{},detection:sheet.detection};if(group.rows.length>MAX_ROWS){group.blocked=`${sheet.name} has ${group.rows.length} rows. Split it into batches of ${MAX_ROWS} or fewer.`;group.dispositions=columnDispositions(group);groups.push(group);continue;}groups.push(await prepareGroup(group,customerRefs));}return{file:file.name,sheets:sheets.length,groups};}
function installStyle(){if(document.getElementById('h38UniversalImportStyle'))return;const s=document.createElement('style');s.id='h38UniversalImportStyle';s.textContent='.h38-universal-import{border:2px solid var(--border,#d6dde3);border-radius:14px;padding:14px;display:grid;gap:12px;background:rgba(120,130,140,.04)}.h38-universal-import h4{margin:0}.h38-universal-groups{display:grid;gap:10px}.h38-universal-group{border:1px solid var(--border,#d6dde3);border-radius:12px;padding:10px;display:grid;gap:8px}.h38-universal-head{display:flex;gap:8px;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;flex-wrap:wrap}.h38-universal-badge{font-size:.75rem;font-weight:800;padding:3px 7px;border-radius:999px;background:rgba(120,130,140,.12)}.h38-universal-metrics{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(5,minmax(0,1fr));gap:6px}.h38-universal-metric{border:1px solid var(--border,#d6dde3);border-radius:9px;padding:6px;font-size:.78rem}.h38-universal-metric strong{display:block;font-size:1rem}.h38-universal-review{display:flex;gap:8px;align-items:flex-start}.h38-universal-preview{max-height:240px;overflow:auto}.h38-universal-columns{display:grid;gap:6px}.h38-universal-col{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr) minmax(0,1fr);gap:8px;align-items:start;border-top:1px dashed var(--border,#d6dde3);padding-top:6px}.h38-universal-col select{width:100%}.h38-universal-disp{font-size:.72rem;font-weight:800;padding:2px 6px;border-radius:999px;background:rgba(120,130,140,.12);white-space:nowrap}.h38-universal-disp.unassigned{background:rgba(200,60,40,.18)}@media(max-width:760px){.h38-universal-metrics{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr))}.h38-universal-col{grid-template-columns:1fr}}';document.head.appendChild(s);}
function panelHtml(){return`<div class="h38-universal-import" data-h38-universal-import-panel><h4>Universal Smart Import</h4><div class="h38-erp-note">Drop in CSV, JSON, XLS, or XLSX. H38 inspects workbook sheets, identifies likely record types, maps common fields, links customers and locations where possible, checks this business for existing records, and separates conflicts/inferences before anything can be applied.</div><div class="h38-erp-row"><label>Business data file<input id="h38UniversalImportFile" type="file" accept=".csv,.json,.xlsx,.xls,text/csv,application/json,application/vnd.ms-excel,application/vnd.openxmlformats-officedocument.spreadsheetml.sheet"></label><button type="button" class="btn" data-h38-universal-analyze>Analyze workbook</button></div><div id="h38UniversalImportResult" class="h38-erp-result">Choose a file to inspect. Analysis does not write anything.</div><div id="h38UniversalImportGroups" class="h38-universal-groups"></div><div class="h38-erp-row"><button type="button" class="btn" data-h38-universal-stage disabled>Stage selected groups</button></div><label class="h38-universal-review"><input id="h38UniversalImportApprove" type="checkbox" disabled><span>I reviewed the staged groups, matches, conflicts, inferred values, and items needing review. Apply only the groups I selected.</span></label><div class="h38-erp-row"><button type="button" class="btn secondary" data-h38-universal-apply disabled>Apply reviewed groups</button></div><div class="h38-erp-note">Nothing sends, bills, pays, schedules, approves, or contacts a customer automatically. Standard manual import controls remain available below.</div></div>`;}
function decorate(){installStyle();const host=document.getElementById('h38DataUptake');if(!host||host.querySelector('[data-h38-universal-import-panel]'))return;const wrap=document.createElement('div');wrap.innerHTML=panelHtml();const panelNode=wrap.firstElementChild,note=host.querySelector(':scope > .h38-erp-note');if(note)note.after(panelNode);else{const heading=host.querySelector(':scope > h3');if(heading)heading.after(panelNode);else host.prepend(panelNode);}}
function selectedDefault(g){return!g.blocked&&g.type!=='historicalRecords'&&g.detection.confidence!=='low';}
function sheetTypeOptions(group){const ask=group.type==='historicalRecords'||group.detection?.confidence==='low';return `<div class="h38-erp-note">${ask?'<strong>We could not tell what this sheet is.</strong> What should this sheet be used as?':'What is this sheet?'} <select data-h38-sheet-type="${group.id}" aria-label="What should this sheet be used as?">${[...Object.keys(ENTITY),'historicalRecords'].map(t=>`<option value="${t}"${t===group.type?' selected':''}>${t==='historicalRecords'?'Not sure — keep as history / other records':ENTITY[t].label}</option>`).join('')}</select></div>`;}
function columnsHtml(group){
  const disps=group.dispositions||columnDispositions(group);
  return `<div class="h38-universal-columns"><strong>Columns — every column is accounted for</strong>${disps.map(d=>{
    const auto=autoFieldFor(group,d);
    const firstLabel=group.type==='historicalRecords'?'Kept as a history field':auto?`Automatic — ${ENTITY[group.type].label} · ${auto}`:'What should this column be used for?';
    const groupsForAsk=[];
    if(group.type!=='historicalRecords')groupsForAsk.push({target:group.type,label:`${ENTITY[group.type].label} field (this sheet)`,fields:Object.keys(ENTITY[group.type].aliases)});
    for(const t of ASK_TARGETS)if(t.target!==group.type)groupsForAsk.push(t);
    const opts=[`<option value=""${!d.choice?' selected':''}>${esc(firstLabel)}</option>`,
      ...groupsForAsk.map(t=>`<optgroup label="${t.label}">${t.fields.map(f=>{const v=`field:${t.target}:${f}`;return `<option value="${v}"${d.choice===v?' selected':''}>${f}</option>`;}).join('')}</optgroup>`),
      `<option value="note"${d.choice==='note'?' selected':''}>Attach as a note on each record</option>`,
      `<option value="ignore"${d.choice==='ignore'?' selected':''}>Ignore this column</option>`].join('');
    return `<div class="h38-universal-col"><div><strong>${esc(d.name)}</strong> <span class="h38-erp-muted">${esc(d.type)} · ${d.nonblank} of ${d.total} filled</span>${d.samples.length?`<br/><span class="h38-erp-muted">e.g. ${esc(d.samples.join(' · '))}</span>`:''}</div><div><span class="h38-universal-disp${d.disposition==='unassigned'?' unassigned':''}">${esc(d.disposition)}${d.disposition!=='unassigned'?` · ${esc(d.detail)}`:''}</span> <select data-h38-col-ask="${group.id}" data-h38-col-name="${esc(d.name)}" aria-label="What should the ${esc(d.name)} column be used for?">${opts}</select></div></div>`;
  }).join('')}</div>`;
}
function unassignedNote(group){const n=groupUnassigned(group);return n?`<p class="h38-erp-note"><strong>${n} column(s) still need your answer.</strong> This group cannot be staged until every column has a use — or you choose “Ignore this column”.</p>`:'';}
function groupHtml(g){if(g.blocked)return`<section class="h38-universal-group"><div class="h38-universal-head"><strong>${esc(g.sheet)}</strong><span class="h38-universal-badge">Blocked</span></div><div class="h38-erp-result">${esc(g.blocked)}</div></section>`;const s=g.summary||{},label=g.type==='historicalRecords'?'Other / unclassified history':ENTITY[g.type].label,confidence=g.type==='historicalRecords'?'Needs type review':`${g.detection.confidence[0].toUpperCase()+g.detection.confidence.slice(1)} confidence`;return`<section class="h38-universal-group" data-h38-universal-group="${esc(g.id)}"><div class="h38-universal-head"><label><input type="checkbox" data-h38-universal-select="${esc(g.id)}"${selectedDefault(g)?' checked':''}> <strong>${esc(label)}</strong> · ${esc(g.sheet)}</label><span class="h38-universal-badge">${esc(confidence)}</span></div><div class="h38-erp-note">Recognized: ${esc((g.detection.matched||[]).slice(0,10).join(', ')||'No canonical fields')}.</div>${sheetTypeOptions(g)}${columnsHtml(g)}${unassignedNote(g)}<div class="h38-universal-metrics"><div class="h38-universal-metric"><strong>${s.sourceRows||0}</strong>Rows</div><div class="h38-universal-metric"><strong>${s.newRecords||0}</strong>New</div><div class="h38-universal-metric"><strong>${s.matchedExisting||0}</strong>Matched</div><div class="h38-universal-metric"><strong>${s.conflicts||0}</strong>Conflicts</div><div class="h38-universal-metric"><strong>${s.needsReview||0}</strong>Review</div></div>${s.linkedLocations?`<div class="h38-erp-note">${s.linkedLocations} linked service location${s.linkedLocations===1?'':'s'} prepared from customer rows.</div>`:''}<div class="h38-universal-preview"><table class="h38-erp-table"><thead><tr><th>Row</th><th>Record</th><th>Match</th><th>Evidence</th><th>Review</th></tr></thead><tbody>${(g.preview||[]).slice(0,15).map(x=>`<tr><td>${x.row}</td><td>${esc(x.name)}</td><td>${esc(x.match)}</td><td>${esc(x.status)}</td><td>${esc(x.issues.join('; ')||'Ready')}</td></tr>`).join('')||'<tr><td colspan="5">No usable rows prepared.</td></tr>'}</tbody></table></div><div class="h38-erp-note" data-h38-universal-status="${esc(g.id)}">Not staged.</div><label class="h38-universal-review"><input type="checkbox" data-h38-universal-apply-select="${esc(g.id)}" disabled> Apply this group after review</label></section>`;}
function renderPlan(){const host=document.getElementById('h38UniversalImportGroups'),result=document.getElementById('h38UniversalImportResult'),stage=document.querySelector('[data-h38-universal-stage]'),approve=document.getElementById('h38UniversalImportApprove'),apply=document.querySelector('[data-h38-universal-apply]');if(!plan||!host)return;host.innerHTML=plan.groups.map(groupHtml).join('');const usable=plan.groups.filter(g=>!g.blocked&&g.rows?.length),selected=usable.filter(selectedDefault).length,counts=dispositionCounts(plan.groups.filter(g=>!g.blocked)),totalCols=counts['auto-mapped']+counts['owner-assigned']+counts['owner-ignored']+counts.unassigned;result.textContent=`Analyzed ${plan.sheets} sheet${plan.sheets===1?'':'s'} from ${plan.file}. Found ${usable.length} import group${usable.length===1?'':'s'}; ${selected} selected automatically. Review detection before staging. Columns: ${totalCols} total — ${counts['auto-mapped']} auto-mapped, ${counts['owner-assigned']} owner-assigned, ${counts['owner-ignored']} owner-ignored, ${counts.unassigned} awaiting your answer.`;stage.disabled=!selectedForStage().length;approve.checked=false;approve.disabled=true;apply.disabled=true;}
const q=id=>CSS.escape(id);
function selectedForStage(){return(plan?.groups||[]).filter(g=>!g.blocked&&document.querySelector(`[data-h38-universal-select="${q(g.id)}"]`)?.checked&&g.rows?.length&&groupUnassigned(g)===0);}
function renderGroupSection(group){const node=document.querySelector(`[data-h38-universal-group="${q(group.id)}"]`);if(!node)return;const tmp=document.createElement('div');tmp.innerHTML=groupHtml(group);const fresh=tmp.querySelector('section');if(fresh)node.replaceWith(fresh);}
async function reprepareGroup(group){stagedRuns.delete(group.id);group.dispositions=columnDispositions(group);renderGroupSection(group);try{const fresh=await prepareGroup(group,planCustomerRefs);Object.assign(group,fresh);group.dispositions=columnDispositions(group);}catch(e){const status=document.querySelector(`[data-h38-universal-status="${q(group.id)}"]`);if(status)status.textContent=`Re-check failed: ${e.message||'Unknown error'}`;}renderGroupSection(group);refreshButtons();}
function selectedForApply(){return(plan?.groups||[]).filter(g=>stagedRuns.has(g.id)&&document.querySelector(`[data-h38-universal-apply-select="${q(g.id)}"]`)?.checked);}
function refreshButtons(){const stage=document.querySelector('[data-h38-universal-stage]'),approve=document.getElementById('h38UniversalImportApprove'),apply=document.querySelector('[data-h38-universal-apply]');if(stage)stage.disabled=!selectedForStage().length;if(apply)apply.disabled=!approve?.checked||!selectedForApply().length;}
async function analyze(){const file=document.getElementById('h38UniversalImportFile')?.files?.[0],result=document.getElementById('h38UniversalImportResult'),groups=document.getElementById('h38UniversalImportGroups');plan=null;stagedRuns.clear();if(groups)groups.innerHTML='';if(!file){result.textContent='Choose a CSV, JSON, or Excel file first.';return;}try{if(!bid())throw new Error('Open the business you want to import into first.');result.textContent='Inspecting sheets, mapping fields, matching existing records, and building a review plan…';plan=await buildPlan(file);renderPlan();}catch(e){result.textContent=e.message||'Workbook analysis failed.';}}
async function stageSelected(){const result=document.getElementById('h38UniversalImportResult'),approve=document.getElementById('h38UniversalImportApprove'),groups=selectedForStage();if(!groups.length)return;stagedRuns.clear();approve.checked=false;approve.disabled=true;document.querySelector('[data-h38-universal-apply]').disabled=true;let staged=0,failed=0;for(const g of groups){const status=document.querySelector(`[data-h38-universal-status="${q(g.id)}"]`),applySelect=document.querySelector(`[data-h38-universal-apply-select="${q(g.id)}"]`);try{if(status)status.textContent='Staging reviewed rows…';const runId=await rpc('business_office_stage_import',{p_business_id:bid(),p_source_name:`${plan.file} · ${g.sheet}`,p_entity_type:g.type==='historicalRecords'?'historicalRecords':ENTITY[g.type].collection,p_rows:g.rows});stagedRuns.set(g.id,runId);staged++;if(status)status.textContent=`Staged separately. Run ${runId}. Nothing applied yet.`;if(applySelect){applySelect.disabled=false;applySelect.checked=true;}}catch(e){failed++;if(status)status.textContent=`Staging failed: ${e.message||'Unknown error'}`;if(applySelect){applySelect.disabled=true;applySelect.checked=false;}}}const skipped=(plan?.groups||[]).filter(g=>!g.blocked&&document.querySelector(`[data-h38-universal-select="${q(g.id)}"]`)?.checked&&g.rows?.length&&groupUnassigned(g)>0);result.textContent=`Staged ${staged} group${staged===1?'':'s'} separately; ${failed} failed. Review each staged group, uncheck anything you do not want applied, then confirm owner review.${skipped.length?` ${skipped.length} selected group${skipped.length===1?' was':'s were'} not staged: every column needs an answer first (assign a use or choose Ignore).`:''}`;approve.disabled=staged===0;refreshButtons();}
async function applySelected(){const result=document.getElementById('h38UniversalImportResult'),approve=document.getElementById('h38UniversalImportApprove'),groups=selectedForApply();if(!approve?.checked){result.textContent='Confirm owner review before applying staged groups.';return;}if(!groups.length){result.textContent='Select at least one staged group to apply.';return;}let imported=0,errors=0,newRecords=0,matched=0,enriched=0,conflicts=0,appliedGroups=0;for(const g of groups){const status=document.querySelector(`[data-h38-universal-status="${q(g.id)}"]`),runId=stagedRuns.get(g.id);try{if(status)status.textContent='Applying reviewed group…';const r=await rpc('business_office_apply_import',{p_run_id:runId});appliedGroups++;imported+=Number(r.imported||0);errors+=Number(r.errors||0);newRecords+=Number(r.newRecords||0);matched+=Number(r.matchedExisting||0);enriched+=Number(r.enrichedExisting||0);conflicts+=Number(r.conflicts||0);if(status)status.textContent=`Applied ${r.imported||0}; errors ${r.errors||0}. Proof Log recorded.`;const cb=document.querySelector(`[data-h38-universal-apply-select="${q(g.id)}"]`);if(cb){cb.checked=false;cb.disabled=true;}stagedRuns.delete(g.id);}catch(e){errors++;if(status)status.textContent=`Apply failed: ${e.message||'Unknown error'}`;}}const appliedCounts=dispositionCounts(groups);result.textContent=`Applied ${appliedGroups} reviewed group${appliedGroups===1?'':'s'}: ${imported} rows, ${errors} errors, ${newRecords} new, ${matched} matched, ${enriched} enriched, ${conflicts} conflicts preserved. Columns in applied groups: ${appliedCounts['auto-mapped']} auto-mapped, ${appliedCounts['owner-assigned']} owner-assigned, ${appliedCounts['owner-ignored']} owner-ignored — every column accounted for. No external customer actions were taken.`;approve.checked=false;approve.disabled=stagedRuns.size===0;refreshButtons();if(typeof loadBusiness==='function'&&bid())try{await loadBusiness(bid(),true);}catch(_){}}
document.addEventListener('click',e=>{if(e.target.closest?.('[data-h38-universal-analyze]')){e.preventDefault();analyze();}if(e.target.closest?.('[data-h38-universal-stage]')){e.preventDefault();stageSelected();}if(e.target.closest?.('[data-h38-universal-apply]')){e.preventDefault();applySelected();}},true);
document.addEventListener('change',e=>{const colAsk=e.target?.closest?.('[data-h38-col-ask]');if(colAsk){const g=(plan?.groups||[]).find(x=>x.id===colAsk.dataset.h38ColAsk);if(g){g.choices=g.choices||{};g.choices[colAsk.dataset.h38ColName]=colAsk.value;reprepareGroup(g);}return;}const sheetSel=e.target?.closest?.('[data-h38-sheet-type]');if(sheetSel){const g=(plan?.groups||[]).find(x=>x.id===sheetSel.dataset.h38SheetType);if(g&&sheetSel.value&&sheetSel.value!==g.type){g.type=sheetSel.value;reprepareGroup(g);}return;}if(e.target?.matches?.('[data-h38-universal-select],[data-h38-universal-apply-select],#h38UniversalImportApprove'))refreshButtons();},true);
const observer=new MutationObserver(()=>{if(observerQueued)return;observerQueued=true;queueMicrotask(()=>{observerQueued=false;decorate();});});observer.observe(document.documentElement,{childList:true,subtree:true});if(document.readyState==='loading')document.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded',decorate,{once:true});else decorate();
/* Flow-redesign (2026-10-10): manual customer entry reuses the exact import
 * dedupe scorer (M2) against local records instead of reimplementing it.
 * mapped: canonical customer fields {'Customer Name','Email','Phone',...}.
 * list: [{record_key, payload}] local customer rows. Returns best match or null. */
function matchCustomerLocal(mapped,list){
  return matchCustomer(mapped,Array.isArray(list)?list:[]);
}
